<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of UBS, lead manager Goldman Sachs and Co said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,500 CHF		 PREMIUM	14.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.55 CHF		  GEARING	9.3 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.MAY.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,448 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
